# nv_nv1 (numerical viscosity fully on, no AV) with SPH divergence + base tensile correction and GNOG off: GIZMO's stabiliser set on the one-scheme base.
# Uniform choices (identical in every test): no tensile correction (GNOG 2 instead), matrix divergence (base), deviatoric force on the MFM face, 2D-traceless deviator as GIZMO, unlimited gradient in the stress rate, no adhesion between bodies, correct work-term sign, no physical viscosity.
RECON_FACE_DV 0
NUM_VISC 1
NUM_VISC_L 1.
NUM_VISC_T 1.
ART_VISC 0
TENSILE_CORRECTION 1
GNOG_PENALTY 0
ELASTIC_FACE_MODE 2
STRESS_2D_GIZMO 1
STRESS_RATE_RAW_GRAD 1
CONTACT_NO_TENSION 1
ELASTIC_WORK_SIGN_FIX 1
MATERIAL_VISCOSITY 0
EXPLICIT_VOL_SPH_DIVV 1
